<title>USA: Rohm and Haas Co to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Rohm and Haas Co to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rohm and Haas Co said Friday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 3.5 million shares of common stock, or about 5.5 percent of the company's 64 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Rohm and Haas said the board authorized the buyback to take place over a two-year period.</p>
<p>The Rohm and Haas board authorized a similar stock buyback effort in December 1995.</p>
<p>That buyback of 3.5 million common shares was completed between January 1st and September 30th of this year.</p>
</text>
